{
  "id": 263241777,
  "iid": 13225,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "DHCPv6: Add option 79 handling (Client Link-Layer Address)",
  "description": "Defined in RFC6939: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6939\n\nSample capture: [dhcpv6-option-79.pcap](/uploads/0a259a01ff87d3a0173d481fffe8fc76/dhcpv6-option-79.pcap)\n\nBefore this MR:\n\n```\nClient Link-Layer Address\n    Option: Client Link-Layer Address (79)\n    Length: 8\n```\n(= does not parse the option contents at all)\n\nAfter this MR:\n\n```\nClient Link-Layer Address\n    Option: Client Link-Layer Address (79)\n    Length: 8\n    Hardware type: Ethernet (1)\n    Link-layer address: 00:0c:29:67:42:7a\n    Link-layer address (Ethernet): VMware_67:42:7a (00:0c:29:67:42:7a)\n```\n(= similar output to fields in DUID-LLT)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2023-11-12T18:26:08.790Z",
